---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description={`Cookie Policy for ${site.companyName} (${site.brand}) — what cookies are, which categories this website uses, how consent works, and how to manage or opt out of cookies.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal">
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 26 October 2026</p>

        <p>
          This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>{site.companyName}</strong> (&ldquo;{site.entity.legalNameZh}&rdquo;,
          &ldquo;{site.brand}&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) uses cookies and similar
          technologies on <strong>{site.domain}</strong>. It should be read together with our{' '}
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit a website. They help a
          website remember information about your visit, such as your preferences or whether you have visited
          before. &ldquo;Similar technologies&rdquo; include local storage and other browser-based mechanisms
          that serve comparable functions.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
        <p>
          This website is primarily a static, business-to-business information site. It uses only a limited set
          of cookies and similar technologies, which fall into the following categories. We describe them
          honestly below and do not use cookies for targeted advertising.
        </p>

        <table>
          <caption>Cookie categories used on this website</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Used on this site?</th>
              <th>Requires consent?</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Strictly necessary</strong></td>
              <td>Required for the website to operate correctly and securely, such as load balancing, session state and basic functionality.</td>
              <td>Yes</td>
              <td>No (exempt under applicable law)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Functionality / preferences</strong></td>
              <td>Remember choices you make, such as a language or display preference, to improve your experience.</td>
              <td>Yes (limited)</td>
              <td>Yes, where not strictly necessary</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Analytics / performance</strong></td>
              <td>Understand aggregate usage — which pages are visited and how visitors move through the site — to improve content and structure. Information is aggregated and not used to identify you personally.</td>
              <td>Only where enabled (not set by default)</td>
              <td>Yes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Advertising / targeting</strong></td>
              <td>Building a profile to show you advertising across other websites, or sharing data for cross-site ad targeting.</td>
              <td><strong>No</strong> — we do not use advertising or targeting cookies</td>
              <td>Not applicable</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>
          We do not use cookies for targeted advertising on this website, and we do not sell or &ldquo;share&rdquo;
          (for cross-context behavioural advertising) the data collected through cookies. Because this website
          does not set non-essential cookies by default, no advertising or profiling cookie is placed on your
          device when you browse it.
        </p>

        <h2>Consent and your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Under applicable law, strictly necessary cookies do not require consent because they are essential to
          the operation of the website. For any non-essential cookies — such as analytics or performance cookies
          — we obtain your consent before setting them.
        </p>
        <p>
          At present, this website does not set analytics or other non-essential cookies by default, and so no
          consent banner is required for ordinary browsing. If we introduce non-essential cookies in the future,
          we will update this policy and provide a clear mechanism (such as a cookie banner or preference centre)
          through which you can give, refuse or withdraw your consent before those cookies are set. You may
          withdraw your consent at any time by deleting the cookies through your browser settings as described
          below.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          Some pages may use third-party services (for example, embedded maps, videos or analytics providers)
          that set their own cookies. These third parties may collect information in accordance with their own
          privacy and cookie policies. We encourage you to review those policies where such services appear.
        </p>

        <h2>Managing and opting out of cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can typically choose to
          block all cookies, block third-party cookies, or delete cookies that have already been set. Please
          note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of this and other websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          For guidance on managing or deleting cookies in your browser, refer to the help documentation for your
          browser (for example Chrome, Safari, Firefox or Edge). You can also generally delete existing cookies
          through your browser&rsquo;s privacy or history settings. You may additionally adjust your browser&rsquo;s
          &ldquo;Do Not Track&rdquo; or global privacy-control settings where your browser supports them.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. The &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of
          this page indicates when the current version took effect.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operator:</strong> {site.companyName} ({site.entity.legalNameZh})</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> {site.phone}</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> {site.whatsapp}</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> {site.address}</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Related documents: <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a> &middot; <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
